p py-[7px] relative shrink-0 w-full\" data-node-id=\"944:1059\" data-name=\"Frame\">\n                <StatusGlyphV4 className=\"relative shrink-0 size-[16px]\" state=\"Done\" />\n                <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] font-['Noto_Sans_KR:Medium'] font-medium h-[22px] leading-[22px] relative shrink-0 text-[14px] text-[color:var(--ees-text-primary,#1f2023)] tracking-[-0.042px] w-[70px]\" data-node-id=\"944:1063\">\n                  접수\n                </p>\n                <div className=\"content-stretch flex h-[20px] items-start overflow-clip relative shrink-0 w-[78px]\" data-node-id=\"944:1064\" data-name=\"Frame\">\n                  <div className=\"bg-[var(--ees-surface-muted,#ececef)] content-stretch flex items-start overflow-clip px-[6px] py-px relative rounded-[4px] shrink-0\" data-node-id=\"944:1065\" data-name=\"Frame\">\n                    <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] font-['Noto_Sans_KR:Medium'] font-medium leading-[16px] relative shrink-0 text-[12px] text-[color:var(--ees-text-strong,#3f4147)] whitespace-nowrap\" data-node-id=\"944:1066\">\n                      EES\n                    </p>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n                <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] flex-[1_0_0] font-['Noto_Sans_KR:Regular'] font-normal leading-[18px] min-w-px relative text-[12px] text-[color:var(--ees-text-secondary,#5c5e65)]\" data-node-id=\"944:1067\">\n                  14:32:06\n                </p>\n              </div>\n              <div className=\"border-[var(--ees-line-divider,#e6e6e9)] border-b border-solid content-stretch flex gap-[10px] items-center overflow-clip py-[7px] relative shrink-0 w-full\" data-node-id=\"944:1068\" data-name=\"Frame\">\n                <StatusGlyphV4 className=\"relative shrink-0 size-[16px]\" state=\"Unknown\" />\n                <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] font-['Noto_Sans_KR:Medium'] font-medium h-[22px] leading-[22px] relative shrink-0 text-[14px] text-[color:var(--ees-text-primary,#1f2023)] tracking-[-0.042px] w-[70px]\" data-node-id=\"944:1073\">\n                  완료 보고\n                </p>\n                <div className=\"content-stretch flex h-[20px] items-start overflow-clip relative shrink-0 w-[78px]\" data-node-id=\"944:1074\" data-name=\"Frame\">\n                  <div className=\"bg-[var(--ees-surface-muted,#ececef)] content-stretch flex items-start overflow-clip px-[6px] py-px relative rounded-[4px] shrink-0\" data-node-id=\"944:1075\" data-name=\"Frame\">\n                    <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] font-['Noto_Sans_KR:Medium'] font-medium leading-[16px] relative shrink-0 text-[12px] text-[color:var(--ees-text-strong,#3f4147)] whitespace-nowrap\" data-node-id=\"944:1076\">\n                      EES\n                    </p>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n                <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] flex-[1_0_0] font-['Noto_Sans_KR:Regular'] font-normal leading-[18px] min-w-px relative text-[12px] text-[color:var(--ees-status-attention,#a5630f)]\" data-node-id=\"944:1077\">\n                  10분 동안 보고 없음 · 14:42\n                </p>\n              </div>\n              <div className=\"content-stretch flex gap-[10px] items-center overflow-clip py-[7px] relative shrink-0 w-full\" data-node-id=\"944:1078\" data-name=\"Frame\">\n                <StatusGlyphV4 className=\"relative shrink-0 size-[16px]\" state=\"Waiting\" />\n                <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] font-['Noto_Sans_KR:Medium'] font-medium h-[22px] leading-[22px] relative shrink-0 text-[14px] text-[color:var(--ees-text-secondary,#5c5e65)] tracking-[-0.042px] w-[70px]\" data-node-id=\"944:1081\">\n                  효과 확인\n                </p>\n                <div className=\"content-stretch flex h-[20px] items-start overflow-clip relative shrink-0 w-[78px]\" data-node-id=\"944:1082\" data-name=\"Frame\">\n                  <div className=\"bg-[var(--ees-surface-selected,#eef3f9)] content-stretch flex items-start overflow-clip px-[6px] py-px relative rounded-[4px] shrink-0\" data-node-id=\"944:1083\" data-name=\"Frame\">\n                    <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] font-['Noto_Sans_KR:Medium'] font-medium leading-[16px] relative shrink-0 text-[12px] text-[color:var(--ees-brand-text,#2f5f98)] whitespace-nowrap\" data-node-id=\"944:1084\">\n                      EES Work\n                    </p>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n                <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] flex-[1_0_0] font-['Noto_Sans_KR:Regular'] font-normal leading-[18px] min-w-px relative text-[12px] text-[color:var(--ees-text-secondary,#5c5e65)]\" data-node-id=\"944:1085\">\n                  보고를 받은 뒤 진행\n                </p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div className=\"[word-break:break-word] bg-[var(--ees-status-attention-bg,#faf1e4)] content-stretch flex flex-col gap-[4px] items-start overflow-clip px-[12px] py-[10px] relative rounded-[6px] shrink-0 w-full\" data-node-id=\"944:1086\" data-name=\"Frame\">\n              <p className=\"font-['Noto_Sans_KR:Medium'] font-medium leading-[22px] relative shrink-0 text-[14px] text-[color:var(--ees-text-primary,#1f2023)] tracking-[-0.042px] whitespace-nowrap\" data-node-id=\"944:1087\">\n                결과를 확인하지 못했습니다\n              </p>\n              <p className=\"font-['Noto_Sans_KR:Regular'] font-normal leading-[18px] min-w-full relative shrink-0 text-[12px] text-[color:var(--ees-text-secondary,#5c5e65)] w-[min-content]\" data-node-id=\"944:1088\">\n                실패로 단정하지 않고 미확인으로 둡니다. 같은 요청을 다시 보내지 않으며, EES에서 작업 상태를 먼저 확인해 주세요.\n              </p>\n            </div>\n            <div className=\"content-stretch flex gap-[8px] items-center overflow-clip relative shrink-0 w-full\" data-node-id=\"944:1089\" data-name=\"Frame\">\n              <div className=\"flex-[1_0_0] h-px min-w-px relative\" data-node-id=\"944:1090\" data-name=\"Flex\" />\n              <ButtonV4 className=\"content-stretch flex h-[34px] items-center justify-center px-[6px] relative rounded-[6px] shrink-0\" label=\"상태 다시 조회\" style=\"Text\" />\n              <ButtonV4 className=\"bg-[var(--ees-surface-default,white)] border border-[var(--ees-line-control,#d5d6da)] border-solid content-stretch flex h-[34px] items-center justify-center px-[14px] relative rounded-[6px] shrink-0\" label=\"EES에서 보기\" />\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] font-['Noto_Sans_KR:Regular'] font-normal leading-[18px] min-w-full relative shrink-0 text-[12px] text-[color:var(--ees-text-tertiary,#6f717a)] w-[min-content]\" data-node-id=\"944:1095\">\n            규칙 · ‘상태 다시 조회’는 EES-58213의 상태만 다시 읽는다(읽기). 재요청 버튼은 두지 않는다. 사람이 새로 요청하려 하면 이 작업 번호의 상태를 먼저 보여준다.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"content-stretch flex flex-col gap-[10px] items-start overflow-clip relative shrink-0 w-[480px]\" data-node-id=\"944:1096\" data-name=\"State / EES 실행 요청 · 효과 확인 실패\">\n          <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] font-['Noto_Sans_KR:Bold'] font-bold leading-[20px] relative shrink-0 text-[14px] text-[color:var(--ees-text-primary,#1f2023)] tracking-[-0.07px] whitespace-nowrap\" data-node-id=\"944:1097\">\n            EES 실행 요청 · 효과 확인 실패\n          </p>\n          <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] font-['Noto_Sans_KR:Regular'] font-normal leading-[18px] min-w-full relative shrink-0 text-[12px] text-[color:var(--ees-text-secondary,#5c5e65)] w-[min-content]\" data-node-id=\"944:1098\">\n            언제 · EES는 완료를 보고했지만, EES Work가 따로 확인한 결과가 절차의 효과 기준에 못 미칠 때\n          </p>\n          <div className=\"bg-[var(--ees-surface-default,white)] border border-[var(--ees-line-control,#d5d6da)] border-solid content-stretch flex flex-col gap-[12px] items-start overflow-clip p-[16px] relative rounded-[8px] shrink-0 w-full\" data-node-id=\"944:1099\" data-name=\"Panel block\">\n            <div className=\"content-stretch flex gap-[8px] items-center overflow-clip relative shrink-0 w-full\" data-node-id=\"944:1100\" data-name=\"Frame\">\n              <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] font-['Noto_Sans_KR:Bold'] font-bold leading-[20px] relative shrink-0 text-[14px] text-[color:var(--ees-text-primary,#1f2023)] tracking-[-0.07px] whitespace-nowrap\" data-node-id=\"944:1101\">\n                EES 실행 요청\n              </p>\n              <div className=\"bg-[var(--ees-surface-muted,#ececef)] content-stretch flex items-start overflow-clip px-[6px] py-px relative rounded-[4px] shrink-0\" data-node-id=\"944:1102\" data-name=\"Frame\">\n                <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] font-['Noto_Sans_KR:Medium'] font-medium leading-[16px] relative shrink-0 text-[12px] text-[color:var(--ees-text-strong,#3f4147)] whitespace-nowrap\" data-node-id=\"944:1103\">\n                  작업 번호 EES-58213\n                </p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div className=\"content-stretch flex flex-col items-start overflow-clip relative shrink-0 w-full\" data-node-id=\"944:1104\" data-name=\"Frame\">\n              <div className=\"border-[var(--ees-line-divider,#e6e6e9)] border-b border-solid content-stretch flex gap-[10px] items-center overflow-clip py-[7px] relative shrink-0 w-full\" data-node-id=\"944:1105\" data-name=\"Frame\">\n                <StatusGlyphV4 className=\"relative shrink-0 size-[16px]\" state=\"Done\" />\n                <p className=\"[word-break:break-word] font-['Noto_Sans_KR:Medium'] font-medium h-[22px] leading-[22px] relative shrink-0 text-[14px] text-[color:var(--ees-text-primary,#1f2023)] tracking-[-0.042px] w-[70px]\" data-node-id=\"944:1109\">\n                  요청 보냄\n                </p>\n                <div className=\"content-stretch flex h-[20px] items-start overflow-clip relative shrink-0 w-[78px]\" data-node-id=\"944:1110\" data-name=\"Frame\">\n                  <div className=\"bg-[var(--ees-surface-selected,#eef3f9)] content-str